        "content_text": "<a href=\"https://www.thepwhl.com/en/\">The PWHL</a> has officially announced team names and branding for this year's expansion squads. This December, you can become a fan of Team USA legend Hilary Knight and <a href=\"https://www.thepwhl.com/en/teams/detroit-clutch/news/2026/november/10/detroit-clutch-finds-inspiration-from-the-history-of-the-motor-city\">the Detroit Clutch</a>, the newest entry in the ever expanding Vegas sports pantheon, <a href=\"https://www.thepwhl.com/en/teams/vegas-vanguards/news/2026/november/10/vegas-vanguards-lead-the-way-with-new-brand-launch\">the Vanguards</a>, my prediction for rookie of the year, Laila Edwards and the <a href=\"https://www.thepwhl.com/en/teams/san-jose-sea-lions/news/2026/november/10/san-jose-sea-lions-make-waves-with-identity-debut\">San Jose Sea Lions</a>, or the new home of half my favourite Ottawa Charge players, the<a href=\"https://www.thepwhl.com/en/teams/hamilton-havoc/news/2026/november/10/the-pwhl-s-new-hamilton-havoc-emerges-from-city-s-furnace-and-falls\"> Hamilton Havoc</a>.",
        "type": "Internet",
