        "content_text": "Buffel bust sees volunteers clear more than 100 square metres in Alice Springs.\n\n<a href=\"https://www.abc.net.au/news/2026-09-08/buffel-grass-art-weed-exhibition-native-plants-alice-springs/107123188\">An art exhibition in Alice Springs shines a spotlight on the native plants driven out of Central Australia by the invasive weed, buffel grass.\n</a>",
        "type": "Internet",
