        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/10/deals-macbook-air-mac-mini-airpods-homeview-trackpad/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/11/Apple-deals-MacBook-Air-HomeView-AirPods-Trackpad.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Amazon now <strong>$150 off</strong> and these Amazon all-time lows on <a href=\"https://link.amazon/B0ccRASzP\">Apple’s Magic Trackpad</a> in <a href=\"https://link.amazon/B0ccRASzP\">white</a> and <a href=\"https://link.amazon/B0fYji9ag\">black</a>. We have Twelve South’s adjustable metal <a href=\"https://9to5toys.com/2026/11/10/twelve-souths-adjustable-metal-curve-mini-stand-is-oled-ipad-mini-and-iphone-duo-ready-down-at-40/\">Curve Mini stand</a> for your OLED iPad mini and/or iPhone Duo down <a href=\"https://9to5toys.com/2026/11/10/twelve-souths-adjustable-metal-curve-mini-stand-is-oled-ipad-mini-and-iphone-duo-ready-down-at-40/\">at $40</a>, the popular <a href=\"https://link.amazon/B00ssqspr\">Airfly Drive CarPlay wireless adapter</a> back in-stock, and loads more accessory deals waiting below. </p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1078224\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/10/deals-macbook-air-mac-mini-airpods-homeview-trackpad/#more-1078224\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
        "type": "Technology",
        "source": "9to5Mac"
