        "title": "Report: Apple saved over $5 billion in taxes through Singapore and Ireland in 2026",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/09/report-apple-saved-over-5-billion-in-taxes-through-singapore-and-ireland-in-2026/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2023/06/apple-park@0.5x.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A new <a href=\"https://www.ft.com/content/49453406-99f2-4f5b-8f5d-01dc8cac5ede\"><em>Financial Times</em></a> report reveals how Apple saved billions in taxes in 2026 by shifting profits through Singapore and Ireland. Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"aapl\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1078111\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/09/report-apple-saved-over-5-billion-in-taxes-through-singapore-and-ireland-in-2026/#more-1078111\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
