        "title": "iOS 27.3: Three new iPhone features coming soon",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/09/ios-27-3-three-new-iphone-features-coming-soon/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/07/ios-27-lock-screen-jb.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">iOS 27.3 is currently in beta and <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/guides/ios-27-3/\" data-type=\"ninetofive_guides\" data-id=\"590185336\">packed with new features</a>, here are three that will hit your iPhone when the update launches <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/29/ios-27-3-release-date-heres-when-to-expect-new-iphone-features/\" data-type=\"post\" data-id=\"1076486\">next month</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"ios-27,ios-27-3\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1078095\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/09/ios-27-3-three-new-iphone-features-coming-soon/#more-1078095\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
