        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/09/anthropic-upgrades-claude-with-new-fable-5-2-model-details-here/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/07/claude.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Anthropic is out with its second big update to Claude Fable 5 since introducing the model class back in June. Here’s what’s new with Claude Fable 5.2.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"ai,anthropic,apps,claude\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1078081\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/09/anthropic-upgrades-claude-with-new-fable-5-2-model-details-here/#more-1078081\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
