        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/apple-store.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple has updated its third-party accessories lineup ahead of the holidays. The refreshed lineup includes products for gaming, iPhone filmmaking, charging, and more. Among the most interesting additions is an “innovative” game controller that works with iPhone, iPad, Apple TV, Apple Vision Pro, and more.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-store,apple-tv,games,iphone,photography\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1077993\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/09/apple-now-sells-innovative-game-controller-play-pad-and-20-more-accessories/#more-1077993\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
