        "title": "John Cusack Goes Graphic",
        "url": "https://www.newyorker.com/magazine/2026/11/16/john-cusack-goes-graphic",
        "content_text": "At the comic-book store Forbidden Planet, the “Say Anything” actor talks about his new graphic novel, in which the philosopher-artist Antonin Artaud is freed from an asylum by Jackie Gleason.",
