        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2023/05/Apple-Google-partner-industry-specification-hero.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1306\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A British Columbia Supreme Court judge has certified a class action against Apple over allegations that its search agreement with Google stifled competition and inflated advertising prices. Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"aapl,google\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1078144\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/09/canadian-court-certifies-class-action-against-apple-over-google-search-deal/#more-1078144\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
