        "title": "iOS 27.2.1 has fixes for security issues in Messages, AirPlay, and more",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/09/ios-27-2-1-has-fixes-for-security-issues-in-messages-airplay-and-more/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2024/10/iphone-privacy-private-cloud-compute.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Today Apple <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/09/apple-releases-ios-27-2-1-for-iphone-heres-whats-new/\">released iOS 27.2.1 for iPhone</a> with bug fixes and security updates, alongside a variety of related software updates on other platforms. Here are the security fix details for each update.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"ios-27,ios-27-2\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1078108\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/09/ios-27-2-1-has-fixes-for-security-issues-in-messages-airplay-and-more/#more-1078108\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
