        "title": "MagSafe Monday: Pelican’s MagSafe wallet is built for the people who still carry cash",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/09/pelicans-magsafe-wallet-is-for-the-people-who-still-carry-cash/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/Pelican-Money-Clip.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">I’ve been on a Pelican kick this fall. It started with the <a href=\"https://link.amazon/B0atb1BhA\">Pelican MagSafe Wallet</a>, then the <a href=\"https://link.amazon/B0eNDVHRK\">Pelican MagSafe Battery Pack</a>, and the reason is pretty simple: once the weather turns cool, I want iPhone accessories built for the outdoors because I am outside more. The <a href=\"https://link.amazon/B0hvUCa7E\">Pelican Protector Magnetic Money Clip Wallet</a> is really helpful is you want something rugged, but also supports holding cash.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"magsafe-monday\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1075452\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/09/pelicans-magsafe-wallet-is-for-the-people-who-still-carry-cash/#more-1075452\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
