        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/05/ios-27-3-changes-the-iphone-duo-keyboard-heres-how/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2027/10/iphone-duo-18.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">iPhone Duo has only been available for a couple weeks, but Apple keeps improving the product with software enhancements. The latest arrives in the iOS 27.3 beta via a convenient keyboard update.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"ios-27,ios-27-3,iphone,iphone-duo\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1077642\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/05/ios-27-3-changes-the-iphone-duo-keyboard-heres-how/#more-1077642\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
        "type": "Technology",
        "source": "9to5Mac"
